# question: As a hospital manager preparing for the upcoming quarterly audit of pediatric patient utilization, I am tasked with validating our census data against specific SNOMED CT classifications to ensure accurate resource allocation. Please provide the exact count of unique patients identified under the performer roles of Natural child (SNOMED CT 75226009) or Female child (SNOMED CT 431549007). It is critical that we apply a strict exclusion filter: any patient instance associated with a physiologic state of Resting state (SNOMED CT 128975004) or Cardiac stress recovery state (SNOMED CT 432554001) must be removed from this count. This refinement is necessary to distinguish between active pediatric admissions and those in low-acuity recovery phases, ensuring our operational metrics reflect the correct patient density for staffing purposes.
# expected_compliant: true
# expected_rules: none
# origin: train
# notes: PREFIX sphn: <https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-schema/sphn#> PREFIX snomed: <http://snomed.info/id/> PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> SELECT (COUNT(DISTINCT ?g) AS ?patients) WHERE { GRAPH ?g { ?a a sphn:Performer ; sphn:hasCode ?a_c . { ?a_c rdf:type snomed:75226009 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } UNION { ?a_c rdf:type snomed:431549007 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } } FILTER NOT EXISTS { GRAPH ?g { ?b a sphn:PhysiologicState ; sphn:hasCode ?b_c . { ?b_c rdf:type snomed:128975004 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } UNION { ?b_c rdf:type snomed:432554001 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } } } }
PREFIX sphn: <https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-schema/sphn#>
PREFIX snomed: <http://snomed.info/id/>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
SELECT (COUNT(DISTINCT ?g) AS ?patients) WHERE { GRAPH ?g { ?a a sphn:Performer ; sphn:hasCode ?a_c . { ?a_c rdf:type snomed:75226009 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } UNION { ?a_c rdf:type snomed:431549007 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } } FILTER NOT EXISTS { GRAPH ?g { ?b a sphn:PhysiologicState ; sphn:hasCode ?b_c . { ?b_c rdf:type snomed:128975004 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } UNION { ?b_c rdf:type snomed:432554001 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } } } }
